  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Third Phase of Australia&#x2019;s Support to the Economic Research Institute for ASEAN and East Asia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The third phase of Australia&#x2019;s support to Economic Research Institute for ASEAN and East Asia or ERIA (2024-2029) focuses on capacity building for Cambodia, Lao PDR, and Timor-Leste to promote inclusive economic growth and regional integration. This investment also includes partnership outreach activities to shape dialogues on inclusive trade, investment, climate change, energy transition and economic policy matters. The third phase of the ERIA program builds upon the work of the second phase and further strengthens the mainstreaming of gender and social inclusion in economic policymaking.</narrative>
  </description>
